      "content": "hey can u help me write an email to a supplier? we got our invoice for the resin shipment from basf and they billed us for 500kg but we only actually received 420kg. i need to ask them for a credit memo and an explanation for why the numbers dont match. needs to be professional but firm. thanks.",
